   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Global HR  2007-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has supported UNDP&apos;s and OHCHR cooperation in the context of the HURIST programme since 1999 with approx. SEK 20 M. The Global Human   Rights Strengthening Programme (GHRSP) is a continuation of HURIST.   The overall objective of the programme is to contribute to UNDP&apos;s     corporate strategy to fully integrate HR into its policies,           programmes and processes, and give guidance on HRBA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ett program f&#xf6;r kapacitetsuppbyggnad kring                  r&#xe4;ttighetsperspektivet (i planering, genomf&#xf6;rande och uppf&#xf6;ljning)    inom FN:s utvecklingsprogram, UNDP.                                                                                                          GHRSP (Global Human Rights Strengthening Programme) &#xe4;r en            forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; st&#xf6;det till HURIST som p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt sedan 1999.</narrative>
  </description>
